# The launch film's voiceover (ElevenLabs v4, "Adam"), cut into phrases and laid on the
# film: each phrase plays from FROM to TO seconds of voiceover.mp3, starting AT seconds into
# its SHOT. Cuts sit in the pauses between phrases. Read by scripts/promo.sh.
# shot      at      from     to       words
hook        0.30    0.000    6.810    You're sharing your screen. You say... "see that button?" And everyone's still hunting for your cursor.
reveal      0.60    7.159   10.420    Meet Pointer... a GIANT pointer for your screen.
tap         1.00   10.583   14.281    Tap to make a point... or keep tapping, and crack the glass.
tools       0.15   14.407   16.083    Spotlight what matters.
tools       3.20   16.181   18.010    Trace your story with a laser.
tools       6.30   18.159   19.900    Circle the bit they keep missing...
tools       9.05   19.979   23.166    or box it in, and let everything else fade away.
pointers    0.40   23.349   24.853    And it's not just a glove.
pointers    3.00   24.927   26.180    There's a laser sword...
pointers    5.40   26.195   27.314    a magic wand...
pointers    7.70   27.357   28.927    a mallet, for emphasis...
pointers    9.75   28.978   31.013    and yes... a rubber chicken.
settings    0.40   31.260   35.943    Every hotkey is yours to change. And it updates itself, straight from GitHub.
tech        0.30   36.072   43.175    Under the hood? Native Rust, drawn at a hundred and twenty frames a second. No permissions. No account. Open source.
cta         0.40   43.348   46.602    Pointer. Free for your Mac. Go point at something.
